"悉尼歌剧院" = "Sydney Opera House";
"雪梨港邊的代表性建築，可以沿海濱步道欣賞歌劇院的帆形外觀與港灣景色。適合拍照、散步，亦可另外安排需預約的室內導覽或表演。" = "A harbour landmark with sail-shaped architecture and waterfront walks. Enjoy the exterior and harbour views, or book an indoor tour or performance separately.";
"岩石区" = "The Rocks";
"以歷史街道與砂岩建築為特色的港邊街區，可散步探索巷弄、商店與餐飲。適合把街區遊覽和用餐分開安排，保留自由探索的時間。" = "A historic harbour neighbourhood with sandstone buildings, lanes, shops and restaurants. Allow time to explore the streets and plan meals separately.";
"皇家植物园" = "Royal Botanic Garden Sydney";
"鄰近雪梨港的綠地與植物園，適合沿步道觀察植物、散步和欣賞港灣景色。戶外步行較多，排程時可搭配休息並留意天氣。" = "Harbourside gardens with walking paths, plants and harbour views. Allow for outdoor walking, rest breaks and changing weather.";
"澳大利亚当代艺术博物馆" = "Museum of Contemporary Art Australia";
"位於環形碼頭一帶的當代藝術博物館，適合喜歡視覺藝術與展覽的旅客。可依展覽內容調整停留時間，入館與特別展資訊需另行確認。" = "A contemporary art museum near Circular Quay. Adjust your visit to the exhibitions that interest you and check admission and special exhibition details.";
"维多利亚女王大厦" = "Queen Victoria Building";
"以歷史建築與購物空間為特色的市中心地標，可欣賞建築細節、逛街或安排咖啡休息。室內活動較多，購物與餐飲費用需另外預留。" = "A historic city landmark with architectural details, shops and cafés. Shopping and dining costs are additional.";
"新南威尔士州美术馆" = "Art Gallery of New South Wales";
"可欣賞藝術收藏與展覽的文化景點，適合以室內參觀為主的行程。不同展區與特別展需要的時間不同，可依興趣調整停留長度。" = "Art collections and exhibitions suited to an indoor cultural visit. Allow time according to your interests and the exhibitions you choose.";
"澳大利亚博物馆" = "Australian Museum";
"以自然歷史與文化展示為特色的博物館，適合喜歡探索自然與知識的旅客。可選擇感興趣的展區參觀，特別展與當日開放資訊需確認。" = "A museum of natural history and culture. Explore the galleries that interest you and check special exhibitions and current opening information.";
"达令港" = "Darling Harbour";
"結合水岸步道、公共空間與餐飲的港灣區域，適合散步、拍照或作為用餐前後的彈性安排。收費設施與活動需另外規劃時間與預算。" = "A waterfront area with promenades, public spaces and restaurants. Allow separate time and budget for paid attractions and activities.";
"Pancakes on the Rocks · 岩石区" = "Pancakes on the Rocks · The Rocks";
"具体用餐地点，可与附近活动组合。美式餐点与松饼。" = "American-style meals and pancakes; a dining stop that can be combined with nearby activities.";
"具体用餐地点，可与附近活动组合。咖啡与午餐。" = "Coffee and lunch; a dining stop that can be combined with nearby activities.";
"具体用餐地点，可与附近活动组合。泰式午餐。" = "Thai lunch; a dining stop that can be combined with nearby activities.";
"具体用餐地点，可与附近活动组合。日式拉面。" = "Japanese ramen; a dining stop that can be combined with nearby activities.";
"具体用餐地点，可与附近活动组合。咖啡馆餐点。" = "Café meals; a dining stop that can be combined with nearby activities.";
"具体用餐地点，可与附近活动组合。泰式及老挝菜。" = "Thai and Lao dishes; a dining stop that can be combined with nearby activities.";
"三姐妹峰与回声谷" = "Three Sisters and Echo Point";
"藍山國家公園最具代表性的砂岩地標，俯瞰壯闊的賈米森峽谷（Jamison Valley）。設有平緩的無障礙觀景步道與遊客服務中心。" = "A Blue Mountains sandstone landmark overlooking Jamison Valley, with accessible viewing paths and a visitor centre.";
"蓝山景观世界" = "Scenic World";
"藍山經典體驗園區，擁有全球最陡的客運鐵路與跨越峽谷的透明底高空纜車，可深入古老溫帶雨林高架棧道。" = "A Blue Mountains attraction with a steep passenger railway, a glass-floor cable car above the valley and elevated rainforest boardwalks.";
"温特沃斯瀑布" = "Wentworth Falls";
"三階層疊式壯觀瀑布，步道沿懸崖鑿出，可遠眺無垠的尤加利樹海與賈米森峽谷。" = "A three-tiered waterfall with cliffside paths and views across eucalyptus forests and Jamison Valley.";
"萝拉花园小镇" = "Leura Village";
"充滿英倫鄉村風情的藍山小鎮，主街林蔭兩旁匯聚特色咖啡館、手作烘焙與四季花園景致。" = "A Blue Mountains village with tree-lined streets, cafés, bakeries and seasonal gardens.";
"珍罗兰钟乳石洞" = "Jenolan Caves";
"澳洲知名的喀斯特地下溶洞奇觀，石筍、石柱與地下清泉在幽美燈光下宛如仙境。" = "A limestone cave system with stalagmites, columns and underground pools illuminated along the visitor routes.";
"具體用餐地點，可與藍山行程搭配。景觀與現代澳洲料理。" = "A dining stop for a Blue Mountains itinerary, featuring views and modern Australian cuisine.";
"猎人谷花园" = "Hunter Valley Gardens";
"南半球最具規模的景觀花園之一，步道平緩適合各年齡層散步拍照與四季賞花。" = "Landscaped gardens with gentle walking paths, seasonal flowers and opportunities for photography.";
"泰瑞尔百年酒庄" = "Tyrrell’s Wines";
"歷史悠久的家族葡萄酒莊，提供導覽與酒窖品酩，可近距離感受獵人谷釀酒傳統。" = "A historic family winery offering tours and cellar-door tastings that introduce Hunter Valley winemaking traditions.";
"具體用餐地點，獵人谷頂級酒莊美饌代表。精緻現代料理與美酒搭配。" = "A Hunter Valley dining stop featuring refined modern cuisine and wine pairings.";
"诺比斯灯塔与海滩" = "Nobbys Lighthouse and Beach";
"建於1857年的歷史燈塔，是觀看海浪、衝浪者與往來貨輪的絕佳制高點，常有海豚出沒。" = "A historic lighthouse built in 1857, with views of the surf, passing ships and surrounding coast.";
"纽卡斯尔海洋浴场" = "Newcastle Ocean Baths";
"結合歷史裝飾藝術立面與天然海水的公共泳池，是享受海風與在地生活氣息的放鬆場所。" = "Public ocean pools with a historic Art Deco frontage, sea breezes and a relaxed local atmosphere.";
"蓝色海洋路海崖大桥" = "Sea Cliff Bridge";
"雪梨往南最震撼的自駕路線亮點，大橋如巨龍盤踞於太平洋波濤與陡峭海崖之間。" = "A coastal drive highlight south of Sydney, where the bridge curves between the Pacific Ocean and steep cliffs.";
"卧龙岗海港灯塔" = "Wollongong Harbour Lighthouse";
"臥龍崗核心海岸地標，俯瞰太平洋海灣與金色沙灘，傍晚日落與海風宜人。" = "A coastal landmark overlooking Wollongong’s harbour, ocean and sandy beaches.";
"凯阿玛天然喷水洞" = "Kiama Blowhole";
"世界上最大天然噴水洞之一，海水被擠壓注入岩縫噴薄而出，是南海岸必訪自然奇觀。" = "A natural coastal blowhole where waves force seawater through openings in the rock.";
"具體用餐地點，新鮮南海岸漁港直送水產與炸魚薯條。" = "A South Coast dining stop serving seafood and fish and chips.";
"杰维斯湾海厄姆白沙滩" = "Hyams Beach · Jervis Bay";
"細白如糖的純白石英砂與綠松石色海面相映，是澳洲東岸最負盛名的度假天堂海灘。" = "A Jervis Bay beach known for fine white quartz sand and turquoise water.";
"布德利国家公园与植物园" = "Booderee National Park and Botanic Gardens";
"保存完好的原始海灣、森林與野生袋鼠棲息地，兼具豐富原住民傳統文化與幽靜海岸。" = "Coastal bays, forests and wildlife habitats with Aboriginal cultural heritage.";
"拜伦角灯塔（澳洲大陆极东点）" = "Cape Byron Lighthouse";
"佇立於陡峭崖頂的白色經典燈塔，俯瞰360度浩瀚太平洋，常年可見海豚海龜在清透海面跳躍。" = "A white lighthouse on the cliffs of Cape Byron, overlooking the Pacific Ocean near the easternmost point of mainland Australia.";
"沃特戈斯海滩" = "Wategos Beach";
"依偎在拜倫岬腳下的靜謐海灘，沙質細軟，是拜倫灣最舒適悠閒的戲水放鬆之處。" = "A sheltered beach beneath Cape Byron, with soft sand and a relaxed seaside atmosphere.";
"具體用餐地點，結合在地農場放養食材與炭火燒烤風味，拜倫灣代表性美食體驗。" = "A Byron Bay dining stop featuring local farm produce and wood-fired cooking.";
"科夫斯港大香蕉主题乐园" = "The Big Banana Fun Park · Coffs Harbour";
"澳洲‘大物’（Big Things）文化代表，老少咸宜的北海岸熱門歡樂休憩景點。" = "A North Coast family attraction associated with Australia’s Big Things landmarks.";
"麦觉理港无尾熊医院" = "Port Macquarie Koala Hospital";
"近距離觀察受傷與康復中野生考拉的溫馨院所，深入了解澳洲獨特有袋動物保護現況。" = "A wildlife care centre focused on injured and recovering koalas and the conservation of Australian marsupials.";
"入口海滩与塘鹅生态水岸" = "The Entrance Waterfront";
